      AND model_answer IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'Local Anaesthetic Systemic Toxicity (LAST) occurs when plasma levels of local anaesthetic reach a critical threshold, either through accidental intravascular injection or rapid absorption from highly vascular sites. Toxicity primarily affects the CNS and Cardiovascular systems.

